---
layout: layouts/identity.njk
permalink: /identity/components/
title: Components
description: The component library for the Teenaz Spa visual identity — buttons, cards, forms, navigation, accordion, gallery and footer.
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="stack--lg stack" style="max-width: 48rem;">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-rule reveal" data-reveal>Component library</p>
      <h1 class="display-2 reveal" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">Every part, in one place</h1>
      <p class="lead reveal" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
        Each component is built only from the tokens on the foundations page. All labels
        and copy shown here are placeholder.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="subnav" aria-label="On this page">
  <div class="shell">
    <ul class="subnav__list">
      <li><a class="subnav__link" href="#buttons">Buttons</a></li>
      <li><a class="subnav__link" href="#cards">Cards</a></li>
